    "url": "https://www.sivers-semiconductors.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Sivers_annualreport_2025_2.pdf",
    "source_type": "filing",
    "evidence_tier": 1,
    "origin_entity": "Sivers Semiconductors",
    "storage_permission": "repo_full",
    "permission_basis": "This is Sivers Semiconductors' official annual report, published as an original investor disclosure on the issuer's own domain. The repository retains attributed research excerpts and derived extraction with the issuer PDF URL and retrieval metadata."
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s1",
      "locator": "p.4, Photonics product description",
      "quote": "Sivers provides high-power DFB lasers and laser arrays for optical links in AI data centers and high-performance computing (HPC) systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s2",
      "locator": "p.6, CEO's Letter",
      "quote": "Collaborations with WIN Semiconductors, O-Net Technologies and POET volume production of DFB laser arrays, pluggable transceivers, external laser sources and light engines (ELS) for AI data-centers."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s3",
      "locator": "p.6, CEO's Letter",
      "quote": "Our serviceable market and opportunity pipeline has expanded to include pluggable optical interconnects as well as scale-up and scale-out architectures for co-packaged optics (CPO)."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s4",
      "locator": "p.6, CEO's Letter",
      "quote": "we are actively sampling several customers including POET for their alpha customer ELS product."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s5",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "In April 2025, Sivers announced a strategic partnership with O-Net Technologies to produce high-performance external laser sources, a critical component for next-generation Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) in switches, network interface cards…"
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s6",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "in November 2025, Sivers announced a strategic partnership with POET Technologies Inc., combining Sivers' DFB laser arrays with POET's Optical Interposer™ to deliver scalable, energy-efficient external laser sources…"
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s7",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "The partnership announced with high volume foundry Win Semiconductor in March 2025 now places us in a strong position to meet these anticipated volume demands."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s8",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "Discussions with hyperscalers and pluggable transceiver vendors suggest a CW laser supply shortage in the next few years as the industry transitions from 800G to 1.6T and eventually to 3.2T bandwidths."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s9",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "We currently have strong traction and interest sampling our CW DFB lasers to several pluggable transceiver manufacturers world-wide."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s10",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "Scale-up drives the demand for high-performance, energy-efficient optical interconnects that can replace copper over short distances. This is where Sivers advanced DWDM laser arrays coupled with Co-Packaged silicon photonics chiplets become strategically critical."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s11",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "in October 2025 we announced a partnership with LIGHTIUM AG funded by the EU project INGENIOUS. It will deliver an integrated Thin-Film Lithium Niobate (TFLN) platform for next generation optical transceiver engines with Sivers CW lasers and photodetectors integrated directly onto TFLN wafers."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s12",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "prototypes will be demonstrated to customers in the first half of 2026 and production readiness targeted by year-end 2026."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s13",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "Scale-out creates enormous volume demand for optical modules, lasers, and fiber infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s14",
      "locator": "p.6, CEO's Letter",
      "quote": "Our lead LIDAR customer will begin production shipments in Q4 2026 contributing significant top line revenues from 2027. …our lead LIDAR customer will ramp production starting Q4 2026, with Sivers' lasers and optical amplifiers deployed across their product platforms for automotive and industrial LIDAR."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s15",
      "locator": "p.14, Directors' Report",
      "quote": "Collaborations with WIN Semiconductors, O-Net Technologies and POET enable scalable, high-volume production of DFB laser arrays, as well as external laser sources and light engines for AI data centers."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s16",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "As these trials progress, we expect a subset of these customers to commit to production plans with Sivers lasers in 2027 and beyond."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s17",
      "locator": "p.5, About Sivers",
      "quote": "Sivers Photonics Ltd (Glasgow, Scotland)…head office and manufacturing facility are located in Glasgow, Scotland."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s18",
      "locator": "p.17, Directors' Report",
      "quote": "The Group also operates a production facility in Glasgow, Scotland, which manufactures customized lasers and semiconductor optical amplifiers that are critical to the operations of the Photonics business area."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s19",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "There is additional strong interest in our DWDM laser arrays with parts being evaluated in multiple labs."
    },
    {
      "id": "sivers_ar_2025_photonics_excerpt_s20",
      "locator": "p.10, Photonics section",
      "quote": "external laser sources, a critical component for next-generation Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) in switches, network interface cards, delivering significantly lower power consumption compared with traditional pluggable transceivers."
    }
  ],
